		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρο-βολίζομαι:</span></b> 
		aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠκροβολισάμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.64
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.73
			</span></i>:—<i>throw from afar, fight with missiles</i>, as
			opp. to close combat, <i>skirmish</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.34
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.73
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.8.22
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἔπεσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.64
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.134
			</span></i>:—
				Act.
			 only <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.546
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
